-dependent. This creates three challenges:</p>
<ol>
<li>the prior is no longer a fixed object, but a sequential process <mjx-co=
ntainer class=3D"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0" jax=3D"CHTML" tabindex=3D"0" =
