</blockquote>
<p>Our main claim is not tied to a particular dataset domain; it follows fr=
om the frozen-backbone support restriction analyzed in Theorem 4.4. To addr=
ess this generalization concern, we add two additional evaluations under th=
e same ViT-B/16 setup to test whether the observed effect extends beyond th=
e original ViT/ImageNet-family setting:</p>
<ol>
<li>five fine-grained continual-learning benchmarks: FGVC Aircraft, Stanfor=
d Cars, CUB200, Oxford Flowers, and Oxford Pets, with a 10-task equal split=
 for the first four and a 9-task split for Oxford Pets</li>
<li>a 5Datasets stream (Aircraft <mjx-container class=3D"MathJax CtxtMenu_A=
