<p>The same qualitative trend remains. Adapter-scoped perturbations consist=
ently outperform the baseline, and AS(1) is the strongest option in most ca=
ses. The cross-dataset stream shows the same pattern, providing additional =
evidence that the effect is not benchmark-specific.</p>
