mrow></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>. This is the key di=
fference: Flat-LoRA studies full-space flatness for LoRA fine-tuning in gen=
eral, whereas our analysis is PECL-specific and identifies the subspace-sup=
ported sharpness that actually enters the bound. The two views are therefor=
