<p>We thank the reviewer for the suggestion. Since Theorem 4.4 is derived f=
or an explicit low-rank admissible subspace <mjx-container class=3D"MathJax=
 CtxtMenu_Attached_0" jax=3D"CHTML" tabindex=3D"0" ctxtmenu_counter=3D"45" =
